    <!-- APPROVAL HISTORY, ADDED 2026-08-31 (Tranche 3, item 2e - MANDATORY, per design P-7, not a
         nicety). RelatedProcessHistoryList IS the Approval History list (see
         layouts/Disposition__c-Disposition Layout.layout-meta.xml's 2026-08-19 comment for the
         live describeLayout evidence - not re-derived here). The five columns are the same
         standard Approval History set used there, copied rather than invented.
         🔴 THIS BLOCK IS ONE HALF OF A TWO-FILE FIX AND IS USELESS ALONE. NDA__c renders through
         flexipages/NDA_Record_Page.flexipage-meta.xml, which gained a force:relatedListContainer
         in the SAME change; that component is what surfaces this list in Lightning. Adding the
         list here without the component shows nothing, and the component without this list shows
         nothing at all (this layout's only other related list, RelatedNoteList, is NOT
         approval-history-shaped).
         WHY IT IS NEEDED AT ALL: the new approvalProcesses/NDA__c.NDA_Issue_Approval sets
         allowRecall=true and recordEditability=AdminOnly, and Recall Approval Request exists ONLY
         on this list. Without it, the first submitted disposition NDA locks with no visible
         pending approval and no recall route.
         FIRST IN THE FILE ON PURPOSE, so it renders above RelatedNoteList in the container,
         matching Disposition__c-Disposition Layout's own placement convention. -->
    <relatedLists>
        <fields>CreatedDate</fields>
        <fields>StepStatus</fields>
        <fields>OriginalActor</fields>
        <fields>Actor</fields>
        <fields>Comments</fields>
        <relatedList>RelatedProcessHistoryList</relatedList>
    </relatedLists>
    <relatedLists>
        <relatedList>RelatedNoteList</relatedList>
    </relatedLists>
